      "text": "Win debates in every chat"
    },
    {
      "time": 100.2,
      "text": "But when I ask what's in your heart"
    },
    {
      "time": 103.0,
      "text": "You just smile and brush me off"
    },
    {
      "time": 105.8,
      "text": "We swap facts like they're feelings"
    },
